      "en": "A feudatory Seuna. The Struggle for Empire (HCIP V), p. 176: 'Iramadeva, son of Seunachandra of this family, acknowledges the supremacy of Vikramaditya VI in an inscription dated A.D. 1100.' Dates approximate - only the year 1100 is attested, and no date is recorded for the end of his rule. The library names no Seuna ruler between him and Bhillama V.",
